    skos:scopeNote "A two-storey, brick construction with a watch office and additional rooms given over to the meteorological section, including a forecast room and met store. A brick parapet on the roof differentiates it from 2328/39."@en .

<http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/eh_tmt2/concepts/160271> a skos:Concept ;
