    skos:prefLabel "Q SITE SHELTER (367/41)"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "An operations room, built to drawing number 367/41, to control the lighting arrays of the DREM type of bombing decoy in use during the Second World War. Unlike earlier designs it was surface built and then covered in earth to protect against flooding."@en .

<http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/eh_tmt2/concepts/160291> a skos:Concept ;
