    skos:prefLabel "ANTI TANK COFFIN"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Rectangular slabs of concrete with a sloping top usually with sides of 5 feet by 3 feet and 3 feet high which when placed in rows were intended to form a substantial barrier to enemy armoured divisions in the event of invasion."@en .

<http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/eh_tmt2/concepts/160301> a skos:Concept ;
