    skos:prefLabel "ANTI TANK CUBE"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Cubes of solid concrete, usually with sides of 3 feet 6 inches or 5 feet which when placed in rows were intended to form a substantial barrier to enemy armoured divisions in the event of invasion."@en .

<http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/eh_tmt2/concepts/160303> a skos:Concept ;
