    skos:scopeNote "Blocks of solid concrete, in the form of cylinders usually 2 feet across x 2 feet 6 inches or 3 feet high. Cylinders were mainly used in road blocks intended to impede enemy movement in the event of invasion."@en .

<http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/eh_tmt2/concepts/160305> a skos:Concept ;
