<http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/eh_tmt2/concepts/70001> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/eh_tmt2/concepts/70000> ;
    skos:inScheme <http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/eh_tmt2> ;
    skos:prefLabel "BANK BARROW"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "A poorly understood Neolithic monument comprising a very long, narrow earthen mound. They may be of single-phase construction, or represent the addition of a linear extension to the bank of an existing Long Barrow."@en .

<http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/eh_tmt2/concepts/70003> a skos:Concept ;
