    skos:prefLabel "ENCLOSED CREMATION CEMETERY"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "A cemetery of later prehistoric date comprising exclusively cremated human remains, some or all of which may be contained within pottery vessels. The cemetery area is partly or wholly surrounded by an earthwork bank and/or ditch."@en .

<http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/eh_tmt2/concepts/70058> a skos:Concept ;
